uestion/problem "Simplify the trigonometric expression $\\sin^{2} x\\cos^{3} x + \\sin^{4} x\\cos x$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186253571 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1666eb4d-d4a7-5e6b-9ab8-611863630400" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2{cos}^{3}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186250744} {:answer/id #uuid "671b51fc-531d-5b84-807b-36d54aed2521" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-{cos}^{3}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186251399} {:answer/id #uuid "8919a4b0-5234-55e6-83d8-2a41e35d8daa" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2+{cos}^{3}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186251709} {:answer/id #uuid "cdf0fa52-e133-5bc9-a22b-a492f6ef6b68" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{cos}^{3}⁡\\theta +1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186252371} {:answer/id #uuid "dea9e82c-1cb6-5360-b9bd-65af00f2d2da" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{cos}^{3}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186252515}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "dea9e82c-1cb6-5360-b9bd-65af00f2d2da" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{cos}^{3}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186252515} :answer-field/id #uuid "e680f585-a890-5cf4-b40b-cc0490be4e72" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186253207}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "254c5821-755d-5778-be48-e9e74787cc4a" :question/math-academy-id "q-119362" :question/problem "Simplify the trigonometric expression ${cos}^{3}⁡\\theta {sin}^{2}⁡\\theta +{cos}^{5}⁡\\theta .$" :question/worked-solution "First, we factor the expression:\n\n$$\n{cos}^{3}⁡\\theta {sin}^{2}⁡\\theta +{cos}^{5}⁡\\theta ={cos}^{3}⁡\\theta ({sin}^{2}⁡\\theta +{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta )\n$$\n\nThen, we use ${sin}^{2}⁡\\theta +{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta =1$ to simplify the expression in the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta ({sin}^{2}⁡\\theta +{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta ) & ={cos}^{3}⁡\\theta \\cdot 1 \\\\  & ={cos}^{3}⁡\\theta \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, we conclude that\n\n$$\n{cos}^{3}⁡\\theta {sin}^{2}⁡\\theta +{cos}^{5}⁡\\theta ={cos}^{3}⁡\\theta .\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186253572 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2d3c858f-72cf-59c5-a71e-bf205cf9510e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta -1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186250937} {:answer/id #uuid "674ed942-0d10-52be-8508-29405e26bf5c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186251401} {:answer/id #uuid "7f7196a7-2009-5537-a45f-466fd8a11ba0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186251625} {:answer/id #uuid "960d1f39-be40-5913-817e-76c42bfe84e4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186251842} {:answer/id #uuid "aec279ea-8dda-5b03-ae58-55db46c2cede" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta +\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186252076}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "960d1f39-be40-5913-817e-76c42bfe84e4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186251842} :answer-field/id #uuid "68b32f5d-6e37-56a0-82d3-ea9051df2dc2" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186252996}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "13700841-907d-5c85-a921-c73f7e19a68c" :question/math-academy-id "q-119367" :question/problem "Simplify the trigonometric expression $2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta -{cos}^{3}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta {sin}^{2}⁡\\theta .$" :question/worked-solution "First, we factor the expression:\n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta -{cos}^{3}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta {sin}^{2}⁡\\theta =2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta ({cos}^{2}⁡\\theta +{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta )\n$$\n\nThen, we use ${cos}^{2}⁡\\theta +{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta =1$ to simplify the expression in the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta ({cos}^{2}⁡\\theta +{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta ) & =2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\cdot 1 \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, we conclude that\n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta -{cos}^{3}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta {sin}^{2}⁡\\theta =2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta .\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186253574 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1815e8ee-c289-5f64-9f4d-5df43b4aab39" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta +1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186250764} {:answer/id #uuid "25423e87-2e31-52ea-9bed-9680a8ad4d75" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186250872} {:answer/id #uuid "380b2f49-3850-505e-a125-48611fc7669a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186251019} {:answer/id #uuid "b6fc9b1c-0a28-54c2-82c9-b8ff1ad7eae4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta " :db/id #edb/ref 17592186252166} {:answer/id #uuid "bb0ddaa2-dc14-5f83-8293-f70b43e52381" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta +1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186252200}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "380b2f49-3850-505e-a125-48611fc7669a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2